coremeta4cat:SYN_b74m-m6rp_IWI_method dcterms:description "Because of the low pore volume of the cermets the precursor solution was added in 100 uL steps, each followed by drying at 348 K for 15 min, until the target loading was reached. Nitrates decomposed by calcination for 5 h at 873 K in static air; granulated to 120-250 um." ;
	dcterms:title "stepwise incipient wetness impregnation, calcination, granulation" ;
