coremeta4cat:SYN_b74m-m6rp_tape_casting_method dcterms:description "Ceramic powder (and NiO for the cermets) slurried with graphite, ethanol and MEK in a TURBULA 3D shaker for 24 h; PVB, PEG and TEG-EH added, mixed 3 h, rested 24 h, de-aired under vacuum; cast with a ZAA 2300 film applicator onto silicone-coated PET; dried 12 h at room temperature and 10 min at 773 K; sintered 9 h at 1673 K (heating 1 K/min, cooling 3 K/min); crushed to a fine powder." ;
	dcterms:title "tape casting, sintering and crushing" ;
	a voc4cat:0007016 .
voc4cat:0007001 schema1:name "heterogeneous catalysis" ;
	a schema1:DefinedTerm .
